# Share Markdown, active Python scripts, and linked POP Word/PDF source files.
# Keep images, generated indexes, backups, spreadsheets, and other files out.
# Narrow these rules when the repository is ready to publish more assets.
*
!*/
!*.md
!*.py
!*.doc
!*.docx
!*.pdf
!.gitignore
/.idea/
/.tools/
!docs/scouts-digital/source-conversions/assets/**/*.png
!docs/scouts-digital/source-conversions/assets/**/*.jpeg
!docs/scouts-digital/source-conversions/assets/**/*.jpg
!docs/scouts-digital/source-conversions/assets/**/*.gif
!docs/scouts-digital/source-conversions/assets/**/*.emf
!docs/scouts-digital/source-conversions/assets/**/*.wmf
!docs/scouts-digital/src/**/*.xlsx
!docs/scouts-digital/BULK-EXTRACTION-DATA.json
